sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Player
  participant C as PhotoCamera
  participant G as Ghost
  participant D as Director
  participant L as Level and Audio
  P->>C: right mouse raise, FOV lerps 72 to 46
  P->>C: left click shoot
  C->>C: film minus 1, 0.8 s cooldown, 1500 flash for 0.13 s
  C->>G: isPhotographable camera colliders
  G-->>C: visible, within 20 m, in frustum, unoccluded
  C->>G: flashHit plays GLB hit clip
  C->>D: provoke calls startHunt
  D->>D: state hunting, 11 s timer, menace at least 0.4
  D-->>G: justEnteredHunt flag next frame
  G->>G: teleport to nearest room if over 11 m, phase toward player
  G->>L: state changed to hunting
  L->>L: setHuntMode lights to 0.06, scream, shake, red pulse
  D->>D: menace rises with proximity and sight
  D->>G: timer out or menace 1, startRetreat 14 s cooldown
  G->>L: hunt ended, lights return
